       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TRUNC-BAD.
      *> Fixed-format column experiment: the COMPUTE line below is
      *> 73 columns wide. The digit at column 73 is deliberately
      *> outside the source area and becomes invisible to the
      *> compiler, silently turning the literal 111110 into 11111.
      *> Compare TRUNC-GOOD.COB and run: make it fit in 72 columns.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-BASE PIC 9(9) VALUE 1.
       01 WS-TOTAL-AMOUNT-BALANCE-DISPLAY-XYZ PIC 9(38) VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           COMPUTE WS-TOTAL-AMOUNT-BALANCE-DISPLAY-XYZ = WS-BASE + 111110
           DISPLAY 'RESULT=' WS-TOTAL-AMOUNT-BALANCE-DISPLAY-XYZ
           GOBACK.
